    "note": "Version read: Am. Sub. S.B. 185 as passed by the House (04_PH); later amendments are not in the text read. In 3761.16 the words 'firearms or other dangerous weapons, ammunition,' are struck, so the riot power no longer reaches guns or ammunition; 'or a mob' is added. The quoted 3761.16 sentence is the post-bill reading. Emergency-limit part is long; later divisions (E) give a damages and injunction action for violations (not quoted)."
